// ---- why ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
text "Why batch is the default" at 40,520 style=eyebrow
text "a run either worked or it didn't - one thing to check" at 40,544 style=note
text "cheap: the machine is idle the other 23 hours" at 40,568 style=note
text "the answer can be up to a day old" at 40,592 style=note
text "Why streaming costs more than it looks" at 600,520 style=eyebrow
text "the answer is always current" at 600,544 style=note
text "far harder to build, test and reason about" at 600,568 style=note
text "\"what did it do at 3am?\" stops being answerable" at 600,592 style=note

text "Most \"we need streaming\" turns out to mean \"we need it more often than once a day.\"" at 40,640 style=dek

legend at 40,672 node="One batch run" dot.ink="The 06:00 trigger" dot.link="One order, handled as it arrives"
